# The machine-local default identity: this file's whole job is to differ per mac,
# so it cannot be tracked. Create it by hand on a new machine (see README).
#
# Its sibling .gitconfig.personal is deliberately NOT here. That address is the
# same on both macs, and .gitconfig pulls it in via includeIf gitdir:~/jwm/ --
# where git treats a missing file as a silent no-op, so an untracked one means a
# fresh clone commits to personal repos under the machine default instead.
.gitconfig.machine
